camera_profile_library.json
*.json.bak

# Loose dev scratch screenshots dropped into the version folders. 58 of them, and
# because each new version folder is robocopied from the last they are triplicated:
# 45.7MB against 1.4MB of actual source. Git history is permanent, so they stay out.
# (The curated README asset in screenshots/ is deliberately NOT matched by this.)
Screenshot *.png

